      "date_label": "Nov 13, 2026",
      "text": "Hydrogen 的审美实在线的，能力可能有些长短板",
      "media": null,
      "quote": {
        "id": "2121054098753785915",
        "url": "https://x.com/leo114119/status/2121054098753785915",
        "author_name": "Leo · Building w/ AI",
        "author_handle": "leo114119",
        "text": "Gpt 6.1 Terra Vs Gemini 4 Hydrogen Vs Haiku 5.5\n\n可以非常明显的感知得到\n\nGemini 4 Hydrogen 在 3D 建模上有着明显的短板\n甚至比不过 Haiku 5.5\n\n所以如果是需要做 3D 建模的任务，不要选择Gemini 4 Hydrogen",
        "media": {
          "type": "video",
          "thumb_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2120976563969597440/img/hkrQQ3JFf30V4s6u.jpg?format=jpg&name=medium",
          "video_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2120976563969597440/vid/avc1/1920x1080/ZPzQwT1PdfwA271x.mp4?tag=29",
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080
