    {
      "id": "2121038972944265616",
      "url": "https://x.com/NekoStranding/status/2121038972944265616",
      "author_name": "毒猫猫 | 量化摸鱼师",
      "author_handle": "NekoStranding",
      "created_at": "Fri Nov 13 00:34:32 +0000 2026",
      "created_timestamp": 1794530072,
      "date_label": "Nov 13, 2026",
      "text": "对 Hydrogen 的第一印象：确实很快，即便是 thinking level high 在客户端里面也是秒出。很聪明，继承了 Carbon / Argon 的灵活性，而且说话不罗嗦，这点非常好\n\n另外暂时没有遇到奇怪的八股文（恐怖极其人啥的），可能是用的还不够多\n\n说到价格：API 定价是 DeepSeek 的 5x（峰）/ 10x（谷）。但 benchmark 上的 per task cost 大约只比 ds 高 20%~30%。据说是因为做长任务的时候每一步的正确率更高，所以可以用更少的 token 解决问题",
      "media": null,
      "quote": {
        "id": "2120940236805169182",
        "url": "https://x.com/sundarpichai/status/2120940236805169182",
        "author_name": "Sundar Pichai",
        "author_handle": "sundarpichai",
        "text": "Following Carbon + Argon, Gemini 4 Hydrogen brings cutting-edge intelligence to everyone. Built for speed and efficiency for everyday tasks, coding and agentic workflows.\n\nCompared to 3.8 Flash, it finishes tasks 2.5x faster. Also has 4 thinking levels, so you only wait and pay for the reasoning depth a task requires.\n\nRolling out today to all tiers of @GoogleAIStudio, the Gemini API, @GeminiApp, Search and paid Google AI Pro and Ultra subscribers in Google @Antigravity.",
        "media": null
      },
      "likes": 3,
      "retweets": 0,
      "replies": 1
    }
  ],
